se the dashboard server was not reachable on 127.0.0.1:4570 from this sandbox (curl returned HTTP code 000), so the required browser poll-cycle checks and /api/execute request-body confirmation could not be performed here. No out-of-scope files were changed.\"}\n3\t{\"timestamp\":\"2026-07-18T15:12:00.000Z\",\"author\":\"coder-sonnet\",\"type\":\"blocked\",\"message\":\"Re-checked FIX-004 on relaunch: index.html code (userSelections Map, saveSelection/refreshModelOptions wiring in both buildCard branches) is unchanged and already matches the intent confirmed by the 2026-07-18T14:40:21.000Z static review (classification completed-local / pending-browser-verification). No files modified this run. Attempted node --check server.mjs, a new Function() inline-script parse check, and curl against 127.0.0.1:4570/api/tickets -- all three blocked by this sandbox Bash approval gate, same limitation as prior FIX-004 attempts. Live-tier verification (interactive browser, real 4s poll-cycle wait, /api/execute body check) still requires a human at a real browser per the 14:31 governance note, which also says not to relaunch this ticket again until that live tier is done. Recommend the dashboard stop offering FIX-004 for relaunch until the live tier is manually completed and recorded here.\"}\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"26c7dcdd-151f-46e6-aca7-c7ba1968525d","uuid":"fba462dd-01d9-4368-b788-ac1441f54b17","timestamp":"2026-07-18T15:18:24.344Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/work945/Documents/Proyectos/ABM/proyectos/panel-ops/comments/FIX-004.jsonl","content":"{\"timestamp\":\"2026-07-18T14:15:00.000Z\",\"author\":\"coder-sonnet\",\"type\":\"blocked\",\"message\":\"FIX-004 code change complete in tools/roadmap-dashboard/index.html: added module-level const userSelections = new Map() (ticketId -> {runner, model}) near the other module-level state (REFRESH_MS/ticketsCache/allowlists). In buildCard(), before building the select options I re